WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.467 --> 00:00:03.167
-Welcome, welcome, welcome
to the "Tonight Show"!

00:00:03.167 --> 00:00:04.801
You're here.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:04.801 --> 00:00:07.234
Thank you for watching.

00:00:07.234 --> 00:00:09.467
Well, guys,
today marks one full year

00:00:09.467 --> 00:00:12.300
in office for President Biden.

00:00:12.300 --> 00:00:14.767
It's been a challenging a year.
When asked what he's learned,

00:00:14.767 --> 00:00:16.501
Biden said,
"Being vice president

00:00:16.501 --> 00:00:18.000
was a hell of a lot more fun."

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:20.000
[ Laughter ]

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:23.133
A year ago, Biden pledged
to address COVID, the economy,

00:00:23.133 --> 00:00:25.567
climate change,
and racial injustice.

00:00:25.567 --> 00:00:28.434
And, good news, after 12 months
of tireless effort,

00:00:28.434 --> 00:00:30.601
we're all getting
three free masks.

00:00:30.601 --> 00:00:32.501
[ Laughter, cheers, applause ]

00:00:32.501 --> 00:00:36.434
That's right.

00:00:36.434 --> 00:00:39.434
[ Laughter ]

00:00:39.434 --> 00:00:41.901
This is nice.
Biden's inaugural committee

00:00:41.901 --> 00:00:43.968
marked his anniversary
by releasing a video

00:00:43.968 --> 00:00:47.701
touting America's recovery,
narrated by Tom Hanks.

00:00:47.701 --> 00:00:50.133
Hanks wasn't the first choice,
but staffers had to explain

00:00:50.133 --> 00:00:52.534
to Biden that Gary Cooper
died 60 years ago.

00:00:52.534 --> 00:00:54.667
[ Laughter ]

00:00:54.667 --> 00:00:57.133
Meanwhile, yesterday, in his
two-hour press conference,

00:00:57.133 --> 00:00:59.467
Biden --
two-hour press conference?

00:00:59.467 --> 00:01:01.734
[ Laughter ]
Biden covered a lot

00:01:01.734 --> 00:01:03.534
and said the U.S.
might not do anything

00:01:03.534 --> 00:01:07.000
if Russia's invasion of Ukraine
is only minor.

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:08.701
Yeah.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:08.701 --> 00:01:11.234
One of his few slip-ups.
And it's a big deal,

00:01:11.234 --> 00:01:13.701
'cause at Biden's age, any slip
could be a catastrophe.

00:01:13.701 --> 00:01:16.501
You know...
[ Laughter ]

00:01:16.501 --> 00:01:19.334
What is a minor invasion?
[ Laughter ]

00:01:19.334 --> 00:01:20.968
A soldier sticks
one foot in Ukraine?

00:01:20.968 --> 00:01:24.968
He's like, "Just kidding!"
[ Laughter ]

00:01:24.968 --> 00:01:26.968
Well, today, Biden tried
to clear things up by saying

00:01:26.968 --> 00:01:29.300
any Russian invasion
would be met

00:01:29.300 --> 00:01:30.801
with severe economic response.

00:01:30.801 --> 00:01:32.434
Biden was like,
"Try me, tough guy,

00:01:32.434 --> 00:01:34.434
and I'll turn your economy
into ours."

00:01:34.434 --> 00:01:38.667
[ Laughter ]

00:01:38.667 --> 00:01:42.200
Yep, over time, Biden will hit
Putin with economic penalties.

00:01:42.200 --> 00:01:45.434
In other words, Biden is using
the same strategy as Netflix.

00:01:45.434 --> 00:01:47.100
[ Laughter ]

00:01:47.100 --> 00:01:49.133
"It's only another dollar.

00:01:49.133 --> 00:01:51.701
Can't stop now."
[ Laughter ]

00:01:51.701 --> 00:01:53.300
During the press conference,
Biden also said

00:01:53.300 --> 00:01:57.100
that Kamala Harris would be his
running mate again in 2024.

00:01:57.100 --> 00:01:58.434
Then he mentioned
they're already working

00:01:58.434 --> 00:02:01.234
on potential campaign slogans
for their re-election.

00:02:01.234 --> 00:02:03.067
Take a look at these.
First up, there's...

00:02:06.234 --> 00:02:11.133
[ Laughter ]

00:02:11.133 --> 00:02:12.801
Next, they have...

00:02:15.801 --> 00:02:17.300
[ Laughter ]

00:02:17.300 --> 00:02:18.634
And, finally, there's...

00:02:23.434 --> 00:02:24.834
[ Laughter, cheers, applause ]

00:02:24.834 --> 00:02:29.234
Pretty good.

00:02:29.234 --> 00:02:31.367
Some business news --
today, Amazon announced

00:02:31.367 --> 00:02:32.968
that this year,
it's opening its own

00:02:32.968 --> 00:02:35.968
clothing store,
called Amazon Style.

00:02:35.968 --> 00:02:38.467
Though, I'm not sure
Amazon Style is the best option

00:02:38.467 --> 00:02:40.300
when your founder
dresses like this.

00:02:40.300 --> 00:02:43.067
But I don't know. Maybe I'm...
[ Laughter ]

00:02:43.067 --> 00:02:45.100
That's right.
Amazon is focusing on clothing.

00:02:45.100 --> 00:02:46.834
Even crazier,
Abercrombie &amp; Fitch

00:02:46.834 --> 00:02:48.701
is going to start
launching people into space.

00:02:48.701 --> 00:02:50.868
[ Laughter ]
Isn't that...

00:02:50.868 --> 00:02:52.734
Well, this is fun.
I saw that Queen Elizabeth

00:02:52.734 --> 00:02:55.200
is getting into
the condiment business.

00:02:55.200 --> 00:02:56.367
That's right,
she's releasing her own

00:02:56.367 --> 00:02:59.267
royal estate tomato sauce.

00:02:59.267 --> 00:03:01.367
Yeah, the Queen says
tomato sauce is just like

00:03:01.367 --> 00:03:02.968
her mother's servant
used to make.

00:03:02.968 --> 00:03:08.734
[ Laughter ]

00:03:08.734 --> 00:03:10.434
Did you guys see this?
Last week, Prince Andrew

00:03:10.434 --> 00:03:12.200
was stripped
of his royal status,

00:03:12.200 --> 00:03:14.701
and now his official Twitter
and YouTube accounts

00:03:14.701 --> 00:03:16.501
have been deleted.

00:03:16.501 --> 00:03:18.400
The Queen was like,
"No Twitter, no YouTube.

00:03:18.400 --> 00:03:19.734
Now go to your castle."

00:03:19.734 --> 00:03:22.801
[ Laughter ]

00:03:22.801 --> 00:03:26.934
I saw that the CEO of crypto.com
just confirmed that it suffered

00:03:26.934 --> 00:03:30.200
a security breach, and hundreds
of accounts were hacked.

00:03:30.200 --> 00:03:31.601
That's terrible.

00:03:31.601 --> 00:03:34.100
I mean, if you can't trust
a website called crypto.com...

00:03:34.100 --> 00:03:38.334
[ Laughter ]

00:03:38.334 --> 00:03:40.767
Hey, I heard that police
in Canada are looking for a man

00:03:40.767 --> 00:03:43.601
who allegedly stole
an $8,000 guitar

00:03:43.601 --> 00:03:45.400
by hiding it in his pants.

00:03:45.400 --> 00:03:49.734
[ Laughter ]

00:03:49.734 --> 00:03:52.000
The first giveaway?

00:03:52.000 --> 00:03:53.267
Guitar-shaped pants.

00:03:53.267 --> 00:03:56.167
[ Laughter ]

00:03:56.167 --> 00:03:57.901
When he was approached
by security, he was like,

00:03:57.901 --> 00:04:00.267
"Oh, I walked in with
this guitar in my pants."

00:04:00.267 --> 00:04:01.434
[ Laughter ]

00:04:01.434 --> 00:04:02.834
The guy was easy to spot.
He was the one

00:04:02.834 --> 00:04:04.534
walking away
from the store like...

00:04:04.534 --> 00:04:06.367
[ Guitar strumming ]

00:04:06.367 --> 00:04:08.667
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:04:08.667 --> 00:04:12.634
[ Strumming continues ]

00:04:12.634 --> 00:04:16.567
[ Laughter ]

00:04:16.567 --> 00:04:19.334
Finally, a home listing
in Wisconsin has gone viral

00:04:19.334 --> 00:04:22.167
because of the house's
unusual bathroom setup.

00:04:22.167 --> 00:04:24.100
Take a look at this.
It's real.

00:04:24.100 --> 00:04:26.734
-Oh!
[ Laughter ]

00:04:26.734 --> 00:04:28.133
-It's weird when you knock
on the door and three people

00:04:28.133 --> 00:04:30.767
are like, "Occupied!"
[ Laughter ]

00:04:30.767 --> 00:04:32.534
♪ Occupied ♪
-♪ Occupied ♪

00:04:32.534 --> 00:04:34.601
-♪ Occupied ♪
-♪ Occupied ♪

00:04:34.601 --> 00:04:35.801
-♪ Occupied ♪

00:04:35.801 --> 00:04:37.000
-We have a great show!

00:04:37.000 --> 00:04:38.634
Give it up for The Roots,
ladies and gentlemen.

00:04:38.634 --> 00:04:40.234
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:40.234 --> 00:04:50.234
♪♪

00:04:50.234 --> 00:04:57.601
♪♪

00:04:57.601 --> 00:04:59.234
-What a great show
we have for you tonight.

00:04:59.234 --> 00:05:01.601
He stars in the new series
"MacGruber,"

00:05:01.601 --> 00:05:03.701
which is streaming now
on Peacock,

00:05:03.701 --> 00:05:05.801
and he's hosting
"Saturday Night Live"

00:05:05.801 --> 00:05:08.767
this weekend
with musical guest Maneskin.

00:05:08.767 --> 00:05:10.701
Will Forte is here!
-Wow!

00:05:10.701 --> 00:05:11.767
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:05:11.767 --> 00:05:17.400
Forte!

00:05:17.400 --> 00:05:19.767
Plus, she is amazing.

00:05:19.767 --> 00:05:22.000
From the HBO series
"The White Lotus" --

00:05:22.000 --> 00:05:23.400
boy, that was a home run --

00:05:23.400 --> 00:05:25.400
Jennifer Coolidge is here.
-Yeah!

00:05:25.400 --> 00:05:30.100
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:05:30.100 --> 00:05:33.801
-And his new album, "DS4Ever,"
is number one

00:05:33.801 --> 00:05:36.434
on the Billboard 200
albums chart right now.

00:05:36.434 --> 00:05:39.033
We got music from Gunna!
-Whoa!

00:05:39.033 --> 00:05:42.167
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:05:42.167 --> 00:05:45.567
-"DS4Ever."

00:05:45.567 --> 00:05:47.834
First of all, I want to say
a quick happy birthday

00:05:47.834 --> 00:05:49.501
to our pal Questlove.
It's his, uh...

00:05:49.501 --> 00:05:51.067
-Aww!
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:05:51.067 --> 00:05:52.400
Yeah!
-Happy birthday, bud!

00:05:52.400 --> 00:05:55.968
-Thank you.

00:05:55.968 --> 00:05:57.834
-So much going on.
A lot to talk about.

00:05:57.834 --> 00:05:59.667
I mean,
it's Questlove's birthday.

00:05:59.667 --> 00:06:04.067
Today is Joe Biden's one-year
anniversary as president.

00:06:04.067 --> 00:06:05.434
This is actually nice.
A lot of people

00:06:05.434 --> 00:06:07.400
reached out
to congratulate Biden.

00:06:07.400 --> 00:06:08.734
-Really?
-Yeah, check out

00:06:08.734 --> 00:06:10.300
some of the text messages
he got.

00:06:10.300 --> 00:06:12.000
For instance,
Kamala Harris wrote,

00:06:15.434 --> 00:06:16.434
-Aww.
[ Laughter ]

00:06:16.434 --> 00:06:19.467
-Isn't that nice?
-That's sweet.

00:06:19.467 --> 00:06:20.901
She cares.
-Yeah.

00:06:20.901 --> 00:06:22.701
And former president
Obama wrote...

00:06:25.667 --> 00:06:27.834
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:06:27.834 --> 00:06:29.601
Nice again.
-Well...

00:06:29.601 --> 00:06:31.501
-Next up, Joe Manchin wrote...

00:06:34.601 --> 00:06:36.367
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:06:36.367 --> 00:06:37.934
-Come on!
That's a good one.

00:06:37.934 --> 00:06:40.033
-"As much as I'd like to --
I just can't do it."

00:06:40.033 --> 00:06:41.334
-Can't do it.
-No.

00:06:41.334 --> 00:06:42.834
-Then, Tom Brady wrote...

00:06:45.767 --> 00:06:49.567
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:06:49.567 --> 00:06:51.300
Next up, Bernie sanders wrote...

00:06:54.801 --> 00:06:58.734
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:06:58.734 --> 00:07:00.300
And then,
Donald Trump wrote...

00:07:03.400 --> 00:07:08.200
-Oh.
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:07:08.200 --> 00:07:09.868
-And finally,
Prince Andrew wrote...

00:07:12.367 --> 00:07:14.467
Well, it's nice to hear
from everybody.

